# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:420
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_8dac9f90:

#   mc "(If she really has eyes and ears everywhere, then Megan could be the kind of person that could help me find that girl from the party.)"
    mc "(Se ela realmente tem olhos e ouvidos em todos os lugares, então Megan poderia ser o tipo de pessoa que poderia me ajudar a encontrar aquela garota da festa.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:422
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_0caf7a05:

#   mc "(But I get the feeling she will know straight away if I'm deceiving her.)"
    mc "(Mas tenho a impressão de que ela saberá imediatamente se eu estiver enganando-a.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:424
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_27c0efe4:

#   mc "(However, I feel like it's worth the risk.)"
    mc "(No entanto, acho que vale a pena correr o risco.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:426
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_2375dd54:

#   mc "Well, I downloaded some files from the father's main computer."
    mc "Bem, eu baixei alguns arquivos do computador principal do meu pai."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:427
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_f1f01a30:

#   mc "Then put them on a flash drive."
    mc "Em seguida, coloque-os em um pen drive."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:429
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_2d126c29:

#   mc "Everything was going fine and it seemed like we planned it all out perfectly."
    mc "Estava tudo correndo bem e parecia que tínhamos planejado tudo perfeitamente."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:430
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_63a97a94:

#   mc "But just as I was about to leave, some girl at the party picked my pocket, and took the drive. I didn't notice it was missing until later."
    mc "Mas, quando eu estava prestes a sair, uma garota na festa furtou meu dinheiro e levou o pen drive. Só percebi que ele tinha sumido mais tarde."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:432
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_f347e8a0:

#   megan "What did she look like?"
    megan "Qual era a aparência dela?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:434
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_f2544447:

#   mc "Um, she was five foot three, early to mid-twenties, with dark hair, although she may have been wearing a wig."
    mc "Hum, ela tinha um metro e sessenta de altura, entre vinte e poucos e vinte e poucos anos, com cabelo escuro, embora pudesse estar usando uma peruca."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:436
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_71fe59bd:

#   mc "But the main thing I noticed was she had a cat-face tattoo on her back."
    mc "Mas o que mais me chamou a atenção foi a tatuagem de rosto de gato que ela tinha nas costas."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:437
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_5e309915:

#   mc "We looked into this and supposedly it's an old tattoo for a gang going by the name, {i}Apex Legion{/i}."
    mc "Investigamos isso e, aparentemente, trata-se de uma tatuagem antiga de uma gangue com esse nome. {i} Legião Apex{/i}."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:439
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_da0db651:

#   mc "Have you heard of it?"
    mc "Você já ouviu falar disso?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:441
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_a0eef1fc:

#   megan "No, it doesn't ring a bell. But I can have my people check it out."
    megan "Não, não me é familiar. Mas posso pedir para minha equipe verificar."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:443
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_135cb980:

#   megan "Anything else?"
    megan "Algo mais?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:445
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_7c6057cf:

#   mc "No, except, our [public_group] leader has given me until tomorrow night to find it."
    mc "Não, exceto, o nosso [public_group] O líder me deu até amanhã à noite para encontrá-lo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:447
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_a5007a78:

#   mc "He's pretty pissed that I lost it."
    mc "Ele está muito irritado por eu ter perdido."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:449
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_3725317c:

#   megan "Well, mistakes happen. It's how we react to them which is the important thing."
    megan "Bem, erros acontecem. O importante é como reagimos a eles."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:451
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_b21ebf52:

#   megan "Hmm..."
    megan "Hum..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:453
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_93be2e0b:

#   megan "Okay, this is what's going to happen."
    megan "Certo, é isto que vai acontecer."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/13_02_The_MC_Gets_His_Bike_Back.rpy:454
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_gets_his_bike_back_c1f28f1b:

#   megan "I'll help you find this girl and the flash drive."
    megan "Vou te ajudar a encontrar essa garota e o pen drive."

